<title>CANADA: Alberta Ag expects 1997/98 crop output at 15.3 MMT.</title>
<headline>Alberta Ag expects 1997/98 crop output at 15.3 MMT.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alberta Agriculture on Tuesday forecast 1997/98 (Aug/July) crop yields and output.</p>
<p>CROP    1997 YIELD  10-YR-AVG  1997 OUTPUT  PCT SWATHED</p>
<p>	   (bu/ac)     (bu/ac)    ('000 tonnes)</p>
<p>S.Wheat   36	    34.5     5,584.6	    6.4 pct</p>
<p>Oats	69	    66.2     1,170.5	   11.0 pct</p>
<p>Barley    54	    56.7     5,996.1	    9.5 pct</p>
<p>W.Wheat   36	    34.6	  39.2	   90.0 pct</p>
<p>Fall Rye  37	    31.8	  37.6	   95.0 pct</p>
<p>Peas	34	    34.6	 356.2	   18.2 pct</p>
<p>Canola    23	    23.9     2,112.6	   22.9 pct</p>
<p>Flax	18	    22.3	  32.0	    0.0 pct</p>
<p>TOTAL:				15,328.8</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras, Winnipeg Reuters Bureau 204 947 3548))</p>
</text>
